    "detailed_description": "A whimsical, award-winning point-and-click visual novel adventure game from the creators of HUNGRY TEA PARTY and My Dear Frankenstein.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRelax into a dreamscape alongside a friendly, hungry demon called Baku. <br />\r\nExplore a world made of fairytales, traditional Japanese legends, classic Western literature, and peculiar scenery where real-life physics doesn't apply. <br />\r\nSolve riddles and puzzles to help colorful characters, some human, some not.<br />\r\nBut be warned... the further you go into your dream, the less you may want to wake up.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay time: About 2 hours<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEndings: 4 (three normal, one true end)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRelease date (in Japanese): March 25, 2019<br />\r\n(in Korean): April 23, 2020<br />\r\n(in English): August 20, 2021 <br />\r\n<br />\r\nMade with: Tyranobuilder and Tyranoscript<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSilver Prize winner in the Tyrano Game Festival 2019.",
